WEBVTT

00:14.688 --> 00:19.170
You've only heard the cold, cold beat A rhythm

00:19.250 --> 00:26.953
made of steel But this is what we listen to This is

00:27.013 --> 00:27.993
what we feel

00:30.674 --> 00:36.344
It's electric It's alive. You can dance to this

00:36.705 --> 00:41.447
all night. It's not the dark. It's not the grey.

00:41.768 --> 00:46.511
It's all electric calibrate. You've only heard

00:46.551 --> 00:53.435
the single note. The whisper and the drone. But

00:53.535 --> 00:59.939
this is for the stadium. You'll never be alone.

01:01.455 --> 01:05.978
So raise your hands and shout it out. This is the

01:06.038 --> 01:11.481
sound we share. We are the sound. We are the

01:11.581 --> 01:15.224
crowd. And we are everywhere.

01:17.865 --> 01:22.906
This is your 80's education A brand new, better

01:22.926 --> 01:28.507
protocol This is the sound of your salvation A

01:29.187 --> 01:33.608
mixtape here to break your fall It's not the beat

01:33.668 --> 01:42.670
of her machine It's the music in between

01:56.902 --> 02:01.325
My mother's sound was like a thicket cage A cold

02:01.385 --> 02:08.569
and empty room But this is like a different age A

02:08.649 --> 02:13.932
flower in full bloom I've never heard this much,

02:14.933 --> 02:20.957
Jordan I've never felt this free Is this what I

02:20.997 --> 02:27.910
was missing? Is this all for me?

02:28.710 --> 02:33.932
It's all for you The high, the low The sappy songs

02:33.972 --> 02:39.213
that make you cry The harbor in the storm, you

02:39.253 --> 02:44.515
know The soundtrack for your brand new sky

02:52.243 --> 02:57.324
This is your 80's education A brand new, better

02:57.764 --> 03:02.845
protocol This is the sound of your salvation A

03:03.545 --> 03:07.926
mixtape here to break your fall It's not the beat

03:08.006 --> 03:16.488
of a machine It's the music in between

03:37.402 --> 03:41.146
Welcome to the 80s, Jordan. We have a lot to

03:41.206 --> 03:41.487
cover.

